---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About and methodology"
  ><section class="hero">
    <h1>About PowerCalc Hub</h1><p>
      PowerCalc Hub provides transparent, free planning calculators for electrical loads, batteries,
      inverters, solar panels, UPS systems and generators.
    </p><h2>Our methodology</h2><p>
      Each calculator displays its equation, editable assumptions, an example and common
      limitations. We do not use your inputs to make server-side requests. Our examples are not
      product recommendations or installation instructions.
    </p><h2>Safety</h2><p>
      Electrical systems can create fire, shock and other hazards. Verify all calculations against
      manufacturer specifications and consult a qualified electrician or installer before purchase,
      wiring or installation.
    </p><h2>Contact and corrections</h2><p>
      Report errors through the project's GitHub repository when it is published.
    </p>
  </section></Base
>
